# What the image does not need.
#
# The build context was 158 MB a deploy — the whole working tree, including
# 40 MB of photographic masters that are never served and the local build
# output. None of it reaches the image; all of it is copied to the daemon on
# every build, and on a server that is tight for disk that is the first thing
# worth not sending.
#
# `public/` is NOT here: those files are the site's images, fonts and video,
# and Next serves them from the image.

.git
.gitignore
node_modules
.next
out

# The originals the files in public/images were cut from. Nothing imports
# them; they are kept in the repo as the source of a crop, not as an asset.
assets

# Local tooling and editor state.
.claude
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Nothing here is read by the build.
*.log
README.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
